              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elvira Silva"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good! I would rate it 4 stars but my two daughers (ages 6 &amp; 4)loved it so I'll give it 5 stars, I used coconut milk instead of reg. milk, after blending I taste it and it was lightly sweet so I added about 3 tbsp. of honey and it was perfectly sweet! Thanks Heather! Elvira S. Phx, Arizona.",
