              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cwby2nz"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good. I used my keifer instead of yogurt. I have made a similar recipe with banana to sweeten and thicken it - like a pudding. I ended up using two avocados, and increased the cream of coconut just a smidge. The first time I went looking for cream of coconut I had a heck of a time. FYI for those of you still to go to the store - it's by the margarita mixes.",
            "datePublished": "2013-02-24T18:58:49.450Z"
